{command} [taboo|help] [args]
Run a macro (command shortcut) registered through 'alias add <name> macro'.
*/ macro                    - list every macro, grouped by access level
*/ macro taboo              - list macros disabled in this room
*/ macro taboo <command>    - toggle one macro in this room (access 6)
*/ macro help <command>     - view a macro's help text
*/ macro help <command> <text> - set a macro's help text (needs access to that macro)
Macro names are registered as real commands - just type the macro's name like any command.
